### 计算兑换代币数量
# 买入操作， 指定花费FB数量 计算获取多少目标代币数量
POST http://{{host}}/internal-trade/calTokenAmount HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "token": 20,
  "actionType": "buy",
  "fbAmount": 1
}

###
# 买入操作，指定获取目标代币数量 计算需要花费多少FB
POST http://{{host}}/internal-trade/calTokenAmount HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "token": 20,
  "actionType": "buy",
  "tokenAmount": 34612909
}

###
# 卖出操作，指定获得的FB数量，计算需要卖出多少目标代币
POST http://{{host}}/internal-trade/calTokenAmount HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "token": 10,
  "actionType": "sell",
  "fbAmount": 1.3
}

###
# 卖出操作，指定卖出的目标代币数量，计算获得的FB数量
POST http://{{host}}/internal-trade/calTokenAmount HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "token": 28,
  "actionType": "sell",
  "tokenAmount": 34612909
}



### 内盘交易 - 买入
# 买入指定代币  1.用户向指定钱包地址转入一定数量的FB  2.后端检测收到FB划拨一定数量的目标代币
POST http://{{host}}/internal-trade/trade HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1dWlkIjoiOWI0MjNhMWVkNDRkNDRlYmE2MDQwNTdlNTJmMDMzM2MiLCJ1c2VySWQiOiJiYzFxNjl6ZDl0djZmazJ6NDh6Y3JucXZ6Z2s4anczbmZxOXVxcGF2dTciLCJpYXQiOjE3MzkwOTcxMDd9.0TKpd6bA__Qe5iZBdUkIFrx3MVV_SoBZIGrSCEovdQI

{
  "token": 1,
  "actionType": "buy",
  "fbAmount": 0.2,
  "transferTxid": "489f11a35f55b7bea64afe77f826174d4914ade4c71bda8ef123b0864f4c0694"
}

